BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 717 Tm (3. Employees) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (3.1 At 06:00 each business day the HR system sends the identity tool a leaver notice for each employee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686.5 Tm (whose leaving date has passed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (3.2 The identity tool disables the leaver's directory account and records the time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 649.5 Tm (3.3 For each account on a platform that does not sign in through the directory, the tool raises a task. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 636 Tm (platform team removes the account and closes the task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 617.5 Tm (3.4 A notice that fails is sent again on the next run.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Leaver access removal procedure, version 2.0 - page 2 of 4) Tj ET
